usiness_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"American (Traditional), Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"4rvAW2dFV24sdGcOLWcU5w","review_id":"UJQ-iaxmV25_KRzh8WlHvA","date":"2020-11-25T00:16:29","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9386149048805237,"text_excerpt":"Amazing place! The ambiance is so lush with a menu of cocktails to keep you there for hours. The olives I got on the happy hour menu were warm, buttery and perfectly flavored. My first cocktail was the \"mood ring\" which has vanilla bean flavored lemonade, vodka and butterfly pea flower. It's $7 on the happy hour menu. I also loved the 51 problems though: not on the happy hour menu but my favorite one there. Definitely come to chill with friends. They have wonderful outdoor seating and indoor and I can't wait to come back and try their pastas."},{"business_id":"4rvAW2dFV24sdGcOLWcU5w","review_id":"jA0sfNXyYC9d9QehMUZJQA","date":"2021-08-17T20:57:51","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9385970234870911,"text_excerpt":"I came with a friend for dinner on a Saturday night and we had a great time. I don't normally prefer to sit outside, but the outdoor dining area was so welcoming and spacious. It is also dog-friendly! To start, I ordered the Chargarita cocktail while my friend had the Inside Voices. I loved the spice of the poblano tequila they used. We opted for the Coolinary menu. We shared the Octopus and Whipped Feta. The octopus was tasty, but a bit too charred. However, the whipped feta was delicious and comes with plenty of toast points to eat with. I also had the Red Pepper Spaghetti, which was delicious and came topped with burrata. My friend also really enjoyed the Paneed Pork Loin that she orde..."},{"business_id":"4rvAW2dFV24sdGcOLWcU5w","review_id":"mSui28QRHZPwIWigsBgP8Q","date":"2020-09-11T23:00:52","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9361929297447205,"text_excerpt":"The food is fantastic and the vibe is perfect! Describing this place in 3 words I would say \"delicious and trendy.\" Came here with a couple friends and we really enjoyed it. They ordered the bone marrow appetizer and devoured it while I sipped on a fun and flavorful \"mood ring\" cocktail that changes color when the vodka and lemon juice mixture at the bottom is stirred into the purple butterfly pea tea on top, turning the drink a beautiful blue color. For entrees I got the basil spaghetti because who doesn't love pasta and basil and it was one of the most highly recommended items on their menu. The burrata cheese on top really elevated the flavor profile of a dish that seems so simple at f..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"4rvAW2dFV24sdGcOLWcU5w","photo_id":"8hEAkxW-zByleJj23mZWIg","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/8hEAkxW-zByleJj23mZWIg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8924152255058289},{"business_id":"4rvAW2dFV24sdGcOLWcU5w","photo_id":"xlFBVHQbdVPQ7eCsn7zrlg","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/xlFBVHQbdVPQ7eCsn7zrlg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8697696924209595},{"business_id":"4rvAW2dFV24sdGcOLWcU5w","photo_id":"TQVhrvzrGosPOPqX2eNSJA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/TQVhrvzrGosPOPqX2eNSJA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8368772268295288},{"business_id":"4rvAW2dFV24sdGcOL